This project is a Cangjie-language port of the behavior, wire format, public
concepts, and workspace organization of the Rust project "postcard":

    https://github.com/jamesmunns/postcard

The original Postcard project is Copyright (c) 2019 Anthony James Munns and is
licensed under either the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copies of both licenses are included in this repository.

The Cangjie implementation is a substantial language-level rewrite. Files in
this repository have been changed from the original Rust design to account for
Cangjie type-system, macro, ownership, runtime-capacity, and IO semantics.
Notable substitutions are documented in MIGRATION.md.
